        <message_html><![CDATA[<p><img title="" src="u_emblem_email_e_001.jpgx" alt="" width="150" height="97" align="bottom" border="" hspace="" vspace="" />&nbsp;</p>
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">NOTICE</span></p>
<p><a title="Le fran&ccedil;ais suit" href="#francais"> <em>Le fran&ccedil;ais suit.</em> </a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Please do not reply to this email. This system cannot receive messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Confirmation: Notice of Occurrence (Harassment and Violence Complaint) </span></p>
<p>This email is to notify you that you have successfully submitted a Notice of Occurrence (Harassment and Violence complaint).</p>
<p>Please note that a member of the Respectful Workplace Team may be in contact with you to follow up on the (notice of occurrence) complaint if necessary.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For information relating to each step of the resolution process you may refer to the <a title="Complaint Resolution Procedure" href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Documents/ViolenceAndHarrassment-ComplaintResolutionProcedure-e.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Complaint Resolution Procedure</a>. Please note that you may have a representative present at any time during the resolution process.</p>
<p>For further information, you may refer to the <a title="Workplace Harassment and Violence Policy" href="http://hoc-cdc/PoliciesAndGuidelines/HRP/Violence and Harassment Policy - Final - EN.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Workplace Harassment and Violence Policy</a> or visit the <a title="Respectful Workplace Atrium page" href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/atrium/en/Pages/service.aspx?s=/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Pages/Respectful-workplace.aspx&amp;u=/sites/info/en/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/&amp;n=Respectful-workplace&amp;cg=(acg:%22071c070c-abf7-4d9a-9601-9b425668fc61%22%20OR%20acg:%22e8a6c0e0-35fe-428d-a762-95d75ce6ae34%22%20OR%20acg:%22b1ba0d3c-79d5-4924-b425-92126637446b%22)&amp;sb=(sbj:%2228afde81-d4a0-4df0-83f0-841a28a3b505%22)&amp;timestamp=1660928535" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Respectful Workplace Atrium page</a>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Occupational Health and Safety</strong></p>
<p>House of Commons</p>
<p>50 O&rsquo;Connor, 7<span data-fontsize="11">th</span> floor <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:rw.rmt@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">rw.rmt@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Office: 613-996-2068</p>
<hr noshade="noshade" />
<p><span style="font-family: 'calibri light'; font-size: 15pt; color: #4c8c2b;">AVIS</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Ne pas r&eacute;pondre au pr&eacute;sent courriel, car il provient d'une adresse qui ne peut pas recevoir de messages.</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 22pt; color: #4c8c2b;">Confirmation: Avis d'incident (Plainte d'harc&egrave;lement et violence)</span></p>
<p>Le pr&eacute;sent courriel vise &agrave; vous aviser que votre avis d'incident (plainte de harc&egrave;lement) et de violence a &eacute;t&eacute; bien re&ccedil;ue.</p>
<p>Veuillez noter qu&rsquo;un membre de l&rsquo;&eacute;quipe du respect en milieu de travail communiquera au besoin avec vous afin de faire un suivi.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Pour de l'informations concernant les &eacute;tapes dans le processus de r&eacute;solution d'avis de incident (des plaintes) vous pouvez vous r&eacute;f&eacute;rez &agrave; la <a title="proc&eacute;dure de r&egrave;glement des plaintes" href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/info/fr/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Documents/ViolenceAndHarrassment-ComplaintResolutionProcedure-f.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">proc&eacute;dure de r&egrave;glement des plaintes</a>. Veuillez noter que vous pouvez &ecirc;tre accompagn&eacute; d'un repr&eacute;sentant &agrave; tout moment pendant le processus de r&egrave;glement.</p>
<p>Pour de plus ample informations vous pouvez vous r&eacute;f&eacute;rez &agrave; la <a title="Politique sur la pr&eacute;vention du harc&egrave;lement dans le milieu de travail" href="http://hoc-cdc/PoliciesAndGuidelines/HRP/Violence and Harassment Policy - Final - FR.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Politique sur la pr&eacute;vention du harc&egrave;lement dans le milieu de travail</a> ou visiter la <a title="page Atrium de Respect en Milieu de Travail" href="https://hoccdc.sharepoint.com/sites/atrium/fr/Pages/service.aspx?s=/sites/info/fr/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/Pages/Respectful-workplace.aspx&amp;u=/sites/info/fr/services/hoc-health-and-wellness/&amp;n=Respectful-workplace&amp;cg=(acg:%22071c070c-abf7-4d9a-9601-9b425668fc61%22%20OR%20acg:%22e8a6c0e0-35fe-428d-a762-95d75ce6ae34%22%20OR%20acg:%22b1ba0d3c-79d5-4924-b425-92126637446b%22)&amp;sb=(sbj:%2228afde81-d4a0-4df0-83f0-841a28a3b505%22)&amp;timestamp=1660928535" target="_blank" rel="noopener">page Atrium de Respect en Milieu de Travail</a>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Merci,</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p><strong>Sant&eacute; et s&eacute;curit&eacute; au travail</strong></p>
<p>Chambre des communes</p>
<p>50 Rue O&rsquo;Connor, 7<span data-fontsize="11">e</span> &eacute;tage <br />Ottawa, Ontario, K1A 0A6</p>
<p><a href="mailto:rw.rmt@parl.gc.ca" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">rw.rmt@parl.gc.ca</a></p>
<p>Bureau: 613-996-2068</p>
</div>]]></message_html>
